  <metadata>
    <name>D4 South recovery scenic drive</name>
    <desc>Stop-sequence GPX: Canhas / Ponta do Sol public base anchor -&gt; Cabo Girao -&gt; Camara de Lobos Bay -&gt; Madalena do Mar -&gt; optional Rota de Banana start -&gt; return to base. This is a scenic driving sequence, not a hiking route. Route ID: D4-DRIVE. Notes: Ordered stop sequence only. Optional banana add-on remains optional.</desc>
